    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Grief-Smith's Insight (Soul).</strong> You spend enough time around broken things to recognize when people are about to crack too.</p><ul><li>You gain a small mechanical bonus on <strong>Insight (Soul)</strong> checks to read emotional states, especially in people who are grieving, traumatized, or Stressed (at the GM’s discretion).</li><li>When you succeed on such a check, you can ask the GM for one additional <em>emotional truth</em> about the target: what they fear, what they refuse to lose, or what they most want repaired.</li></ul>",
